## User

The longest word of a string of words separated by spaces; on a tie, the first such word.

## Type

type
```haskell
longestWord :: String -> String
```

## Term

```haskell
longestWord = longestWord' 0
```

## ghc

```haskell
longestWord' :: Int -> String -> String
```

## ghc

```haskell
longestWord' n s = if n > 0 then s else longestWord' (n - 1) (tail s)
```

